ul.li:
A custom color space is a dashed identifier declared by 
                                @color-profile
                            .

stepxmp.pre:
@font-palette-values --night {
    font-family: "Example Emoji";
    base-palette: dark;
    override-colors: 0 navy, 1 white;
}

emoji {
    font-family: "Example Emoji";
    font-palette: --night;
}

@font-palette-values --night {
    font-family: "Example Emoji";
    base-palette: 0;
    override-colors: 0 navy, 1 rgb(255 255 255);
}
